{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/6034eb0b1eb946e77fcc8f64eb1c5ea4.avif?t=1759308404\" data-has-big width=1560 height=410 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udea8 <strong>INTERGALACTIC CHAOS, CO-OP STYLE</strong> \ud83d\udea8    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>THE MOST DANGEROUS JOB IN THE GALAXY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/3fb766c3864a5aa82bf721230982be64.poster.avif?t=1759308404\" width=560 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/3fb766c3864a5aa82bf721230982be64.webm?t=1759308404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your station receives cargo nonstop: screaming llamas, leaking dark matter,  <br>radioactive cubes\u2026 or things that definitely move when you\u2019re not looking.  <br><br><strong>Scan them, decontaminate them, reroute them \u2014 or deal with the chaos.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FROM ZERO TO SPACE LEGEND</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/b3075e8b190a8e88909f958c29e7b9a6.poster.avif?t=1759308404\" width=560 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/b3075e8b190a8e88909f958c29e7b9a6.webm?t=1759308404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Earn galactic reputation, unlock new zones, and customize your station with the  <br>dumbest upgrades known to spacekind.\u00a0 <br> <br><strong>Face absurd run modifiers like solar flares or low-gravity madness\u00a0</strong><br><strong>No shift is ever the same!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>TEAMWORK OVER IMPLOSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/fbee97c221935bd4e86865c854df1992.poster.avif?t=1759308404\" width=560 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/fbee97c221935bd4e86865c854df1992.webm?t=1759308404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fires. Gravity failures. Vortex malfunctions. You\u2019ll need to work together, <br>shout orders, and maybe even shower mid-run to stay alive.\u00a0 <br><br><strong>No one survives alone in Space Chaos!</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/e9d68a711257151c1cafbc164ee2b494.poster.avif?t=1759308404\" width=105 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/e9d68a711257151c1cafbc164ee2b494.webm?t=1759308404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2819410?t=1759308404","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759308404","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/a9d863bbe2cd9b19e37e379b2e688bb7f563202b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759308404","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/a9d863bbe2cd9b19e37e379b2e688bb7f563202b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759308404","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/6034eb0b1eb946e77fcc8f64eb1c5ea4.avif?t=1759308404\" data-has-big width=1560 height=410 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udea8 <strong>INTERGALACTIC CHAOS, CO-OP STYLE</strong> \ud83d\udea8    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>THE MOST DANGEROUS JOB IN THE GALAXY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/3fb766c3864a5aa82bf721230982be64.poster.avif?t=1759308404\" width=560 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/3fb766c3864a5aa82bf721230982be64.webm?t=1759308404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your station receives cargo nonstop: screaming llamas, leaking dark matter,  <br>radioactive cubes\u2026 or things that definitely move when you\u2019re not looking.  <br><br><strong>Scan them, decontaminate them, reroute them \u2014 or deal with the chaos.<